    "## Compare: with RAG vs. without RAG, evaluated with RAGAS\n",
    "\n",
    "We now generate answers **with** retrieved context (the `rag_answer` function above) and **without** any context (the model answering from parametric memory alone), then score both with [RAGAS](https://docs.ragas.io/). RAGAS uses an LLM as a judge plus an embedding model — here we reuse the already-loaded `tiny-aya-earth` model and the `baai_embder` embeddings so everything stays local.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note:** `reference` below holds the ground-truth answers RAGAS compares against. The ones filled in are placeholders based on general knowledge of the Battle of Adwa — replace them with answers you've verified against your own `adwa.txt` before trusting the scores."
   ]
  },
  
    },
